    "aboutHeading": "Background & Approach",
    "aboutBio1": "I'm Zolepto. Six years ago, I started a channel with zero knowledge and grew it from the ground up. Every mistake became a building block, and along the way I picked up video editing, motion design, thumbnails, and branding.",
